    "weaker": [],
    "explanation": "Jaina's excellent waveclear makes her particularly effective on Maps where the Objective requires the rapid destruction of several small enemies, or where quick rotations are expected. She also becomes quite proficient at claiming Mercenary Camps as well past Hero Level 7. She tends to be weaker on Maps where she might need to be isolated, although she should probably never be left without an ally regardless, due to her dependence on peeling."
  },
  "builds": [
    {
      "name": "Frostbolt Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Jaina's Frostbolt Build seeks to improve Jaina's sustain damage output through the several synergistic Talents which empower Frostbolt. By picking Ice Lance at Level 7 and Northern Exposure at Level 16, it also provides Jaina with the most single target sustained and burst damage among her builds. Fingers of Frost provides much needed Mana and a bit of extra damage; Frost Shards makes Frostbolt more difficult to block and potentially doubles its damage; Ice Lance situationally halves Frostbolt's cooldown, which is particularly significant when combined with Icy Veins; Summon Water Elemental provides a reliable way to keep targets Chilled through Frostbite.\n\nIt is important to note that Winter's Reach is an option at Level 1, but should only be chosen against several high ranged Heroes, as it is necessary to apply pressure on them.",
